    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19cd6c050bd465aece141da4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得，这句话的意思大概不是说“不开心”，\r\n而是在说她一直在思考其他的事情……\r\n是什么事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c90f1984d6b25a4d552dd79adce39b840033ad78a76e4e74af6b9f225e62f1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a96211f74cbf4cfab7244c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真是个不可思议的少女啊。\r\n她就如那镜中所见的虚像那般触不可及——但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11714ee98967cde5690247b0145a07d799081e23f3cb58088da34bd4a6ce7e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52095e986f4be6b5b835fb5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我所见到的新宇宙，似乎对于无法用我所能理解的语言\r\n回答我的问题而感到困惑，与一个普通的少女别无两样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ff53f633cfedf6861bdecd577b4d51c683998e228644115acf048badc983833",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2aeb59d00bdf9989aa9a5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这反差，令我不禁再度发笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf51e0c338bc5964074d0bdc8bc6a1efd5622820325a2c726d040af08ef6e006",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
