      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这视线的来源我也清清楚楚……\r\n毕竟，也只有她会不停地出现在我的视野里。\r\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a340f8ae0025e6827bc0f66e21d609ea5c56bd313b33118cedb91f950aa52ac",
